            <title>[ZEPPELIN-6096] Cursor appears cut off in Notebook editor (0.11.2)</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-6096</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;The cursor in the notebook editor is partially cut off, making it difficult to see the full cursor.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Steps to reproduce:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Make a new Paragraph.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Refresh the page.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Click on the paragraph to make the cursor blink.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Zeppelin version: 0.11.2&lt;/p&gt;</description>
